@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:5270

### Search products through the API Gateway
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/gateway/products?search=shirt
Accept: application/json

###

### Ask the local FAQ fallback chatbot
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/support/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "How can I check my order status?"
}

###

### Get cross-customer recommendations for the signed-in user
# Replace {{token}} with a JWT returned by /gateway/auth/login.
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/gateway/recommendations/for-you
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get products frequently purchased with a variant
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/gateway/recommendations/variants/1/also-bought
Accept: application/json
